{"symbol":"SAFECURE","yahoo":"SAFECURE.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Safecure Services Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Security & Protection Services","website":"https://safecure.in","about":"Safecure Services Limited provides private security, e-surveillance, facility management services, event security management, and interior fit-out projects in India. It offers security services, such as manned guarding services, mobile patrols, CCTV monitoring, alarm response, event security, and risk assessment and management; facility management services, including repair and maintenance of ATMs, cleaning and janitorial services, maintenance and repairs, waste management, landscaping and groundskeeping, and HVAC and electrical systems management; and e-surveillance services, such as monitored intrusion alarm system and services. The company also provides corporate interior fit out work comprising project planning and management, planning and designing, procurement and handling logistics, implementation / installation, testing and commissioning, and handover and training. In addition, the company offers facility management services, including cleaning, housekeeping, and pest control management; ATM management services, which encompass repair and maintenance; and alarm monitoring and response services, including the installation of electronic security devices and systems. It serves banks, corporate, educational institutions, residential complexes, industrial facilities, healthcare institutions, and retail and commercial establishments. The company was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Thane, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:13:31+00:00","quote":{"price":24.88,"prevClose":26.27,"marketCap":24.98,"high52":81.6,"low52":18.65,"pe":3.61,"bookValue":42.71,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":16.7,"shares":1.004,"insiders":72.59,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-11-06","2025-11-07","2025-11-10","2025-11-11","2025-11-12","2025-11-13","2025-11-14","2025-11-